# IssueSight Architecture Rules

## Directory Structure
- Frontend (Next.js) lives in `/web` directory
- Go microservices live in `/backend` subdirectories (gateway, collector, ai-processor)
- Shared Go packages live in `/internal` (platform, domain)
- Deployment configs live in `/deployments`

## Code Organization
- Each service in `/backend` is independent and can be built/run separately
- Shared logic should be placed in `/internal` packages
- Frontend service in `/web` is a separate Next.js application

## Best Practices
- Do not hardcode configuration values
- Use environment variables for service configuration
- Keep services decoupled and independent
